---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<MarketingLayout title="Our Team - Marker" description="Meet the Marker team. Two-time YC founders who sold their last company to Gap Inc. and started its Office of AI.">
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8 py-24 md:py-32">
      <p class="ink-reveal text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary/70 mb-4">
        About us
      </p>
      <h1 class="ink-reveal text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground leading-[1.1] md:text-5xl max-w-2xl">
        Built by operators, not observers
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        <p class="ink-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 100">
          Marker's founders have been building companies together for over 15 years. Their last company, Drapr, a virtual try-on platform, was acquired by Gap Inc.
        </p>
        <p class="ink-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 200">
          After the acquisition, they spent three years inside Gap working across every function from individual contributors to the C-suite. They started and ran the company's Generative AI program and led cross-functional, cross-brand initiatives spanning product development, merchandising, and supply chain.
        </p>
        <p class="ink-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 300">
          That experience made one thing clear: enterprises stall on process, and the transformations they pay for come back as decks. The work of actually rebuilding how a company operates never gets done. Marker was founded to do that work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ink-reveal mt-14 flex items-center gap-3" style="--reveal-delay: 400">
        <img
          src="/yc-logo.svg"
          alt="Y Combinator"
          class="h-12 w-12"
        />
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-muted-foreground">Backed by Y Combinator</span>
      </div>

      <div class="ink-reveal mt-16 border-t border-border pt-10" style="--reveal-delay: 500">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">
          Want to learn more?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
          30 minutes on what we'd automate first in your org.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a
            href="https://info.onmarker.com/book-a-demo"
            class="btn-molding inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center px-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer"
          >
            Book a call
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MarketingLayout>
